<title>NETHERLANDS: VIB first half total result higher.</title>
<headline>VIB first half total result higher.</headline>
<dateline>ZEIST, Netherlands 1996-08-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>First half 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Total investment result	   79.4  vs  15.4</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)	 2.05 vs   0.41</p>
<p>    Direct investment result	  65.3  vs  68.8</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)	 1.69 vs  1.82</p>
<p>    Indirect investment		 14.1  vs  53.4 loss</p>
<p>    Ditto per share (guilders)	 0.36 vs  1.41 loss</p>
<p>Note - Full company name of property fund is VIB NV. -- Amsterdam Newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
</text>
